{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15931","headline":"宋氏五女 · 王建","name":"宋氏五女","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五女誓终养，贞孝内自持。\n兔丝自萦纡，不上青松枝。\n晨昏在亲傍，闲则读书诗。\n自得圣人心，不因儒者知。\n少年绝音华，贵绝父母词。\n素钗垂两髦，短窄古时衣。\n行成闻四方，徵诏环佩随。\n同时入皇宫，联影步玉墀。\n乡中尚其风，重爲修茅茨。\n圣朝有良史，将此爲女师。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15931.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15931","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}